flowchart TD
    A[Recovery verified] --> B[Bind incident identity]
    B --> C{Impact window complete?}
    C -->|否| X1[BLOCKED_IMPACT]
    C -->|是| D{Critical follow-ups owned?}
    D -->|否| X2[BLOCKED_FOLLOWUP]
    D -->|是| E{Postmortem and learning bound?}
    E -->|否| X3[BLOCKED_LEARNING]
    E -->|是| F{Closeout approval valid?}
    F -->|否| X4[BLOCKED_APPROVAL]
    F -->|是| G[CLOSEOUT_ELIGIBLE]
    G --> H[Human closes incident]
